                "display_name": "[redacted]",
                "description": "Restyles ONE source video (4s–2min) into a vertical 9:16 reel in a style preset the USER picks — this employee always asks the user to choose the preset and aspect ratio first, then an AI director applies that look automatically. Use when the user wants to \"restyle\", \"make a reel/short in <style>\", or pick a look for a clip. Not for cutting existing YouTube footage (that is Personal Clipper).",
